# Contact form ("Invite Andrew") — powered by Web3Forms.
#
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com, enter the email address that should RECEIVE
#    inquiries (Andrew's inbox), and you'll get an access key by email.
# 2. Put that key here, and set the same variable in Vercel:
#    Project → Settings → Environment Variables (Production + Preview).
#
# Vite inlines VITE_* vars at BUILD time, so this must be set before the build
# runs (Vercel does this automatically). The key is not a secret — it only
# identifies which inbox receives submissions and can be rotated anytime.
#
# For local dev, copy this file to .env.local and fill in the key.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=

# Map tiles ("A Walk Through Manhattan") — CARTO basemaps.
#
# CARTO serves "API KEY REQUIRED" placeholder tiles without a key. Get a free
# one at https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey (emailed, no password), put it here
# and in Vercel (Production + Preview). Like the Web3Forms key it ships to the
# browser in every tile URL, so it is not a secret.
VITE_CARTO_KEY=
